B.HN=s(["Built and maintained the customer app and the internal operations app (Android and iOS) in a team of about six developers; the customer app spans 45 feature modules.","Worked on the payment flows: card payments through Moyasar, Apple Pay and Noon, wallet deductions, invoices, quotations, discounts and VAT.","Delivered car rental through a third-party rental partner's API, gift packages, subscriptions, a loyalty-points and referral programme, order scheduling with time slots, towing, and insurance and B2B orders.","Set up over-the-air updates with Shorebird code push, including automatic patch install and a CI patch workflow, and handled release branches across dev, staging, UAT and production.","Integrated a driving-behaviour (telematics) SDK natively on iOS (Swift packages) and Android, and added an iOS notification service extension for rich push notifications.","Instrumented the app with Adjust (events and revenue), PostHog, CleverTap and Firebase Analytics, and migrated Firebase Dynamic Links to native deep links.","Refactored features into Clean Architecture domain and presentation layers, moved API base URLs to Firebase Remote Config, and resolved crashes reported through Sentry.","Operations app: chat with pagination and group mentions, spare-parts quotations and purchase orders, towing flows and order confirmation codes.","Flutter Web: contributed to the web version of the customer app, including a white-label build for a banking partner and card payments on web.","Built seasonal mini-games with the Flame engine for Ramadan, Eid and national-day campaigns to increase engagement."],t.s)
