B.H4=s(["Built and maintained Safe Home (community incident reporting, missing-person searches, live location sharing) and Safe Work (workplace hazard reporting) for Android and iOS.",'Implemented "report and join": responders join an incident, connect in a voice call and coordinate, backed by Firebase Cloud Functions.'],t.s)
