B.HC=s(["Built and maintained the patient app: doctor search, booking for consultations, labs and radiology, and video consultations with Twilio Programmable Video.","Built and maintained the doctor and nurse app: appointment management, digital prescriptions and wallets.","Stack: BLoC, Firebase Cloud Messaging, Pusher for real-time updates, Google Maps and deep links."],t.s)
